        "t1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong><em>Too many supplements promise results without delivering them.</em></strong></p><p>At Velobiotics, we believe wellness products should earn trust through performance, not hype. Effectiveness matters more than buzzwords, and absorption matters more than inflated numbers.</p><p>If probiotics can't survive heat, moisture, and stomach acid, they can't support your health — no matter how impressive the label looks. That's why we focus on survivability first, ensuring what you take actually reaches your system alive and active.</p><p><em>It's not about taking more. It's about taking what works.</em></p>",
