        "t1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Velobiotics uses <strong>advanced micro-encapsulation technology</strong> to protect probiotics from heat, moisture, and stomach acid — allowing significantly more live bacteria to reach the gut.</p><p>This protective approach helps probiotics remain stable before consumption and intact during digestion, releasing only when they reach the environment where they're needed most. The result is improved absorption, better balance, and more consistent support for gut and overall wellness.</p><p><strong><em>By prioritising delivery over claims, Velobiotics creates probiotic solutions designed for real effectiveness — not just good intentions.</em></strong></p>",
